  "question": "Which viewpoint are situated within 90 kilometers following the south direction from Butterfield Garage Art Gallery, Saint Augustine, FL?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.319514 29.891225)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.319514 29.891225)',4326)::geography, 90000)\nAND tourism = 'viewpoint'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 157.5 AND 202.5;\n",
